- row  `↯/s.130.1.1`  `NotAnSvg`  `[↯/s.130.1.1] the root element was <<label>> instead of <svg>`
+ row  `↯/s.130.1.1`  `NotAnSvg`  `[↯/s.130.1.1] the root element was <<label>> instead of <svg>`

